  "task": "X44 h=4 centered max-shell bound",
  "theorem": "Let M=max_s m_s over nonzero pair-sum shells.  Since C(m,4)/m is increasing for m>=4, X42's sum_s C(m_s,4) is at most C(M,4)/M times sum_s m_s, and sum_s m_s <= C(n,2).  Thus R_centered <= C(M,4) C(n,2)/M.  Any row with this bound <= n^3 has the centered affine branch safely inside the rewired terminal column."
